{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "bequea-s-happiness-report",
  "name": "Bequea's Happiness Report",
  "sortId": 137704,
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Bequea%27s_Happiness_Report",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-09-02T11:49:18.990Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Happiness Report, Day 1:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I signed the papers for the surgery today, and now sleep won't come."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The pain isn't what's keeping me awake. It's just... lying in this hospital bed, my head is suddenly swimming with memories."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The windows, painted a cheerful yellow. The floor, so warm from the afternoon sun's caress."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mom's fluffy red bean cakes. Dad, pretending to read the paper but really watching me sulk."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And Rocket's there, too, tail thumping softly in the corner..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A world with no sadness, no pain. No blood on the table. No Rocket, filthy and scared."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This feels like a good sign. The merciful \"Aha\" will return that pure joy to me... THEY have to."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-56a689c6785d3e11"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Happiness Report, Day 3:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The doctor came by. He walked me through the surgery."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "He says a needle, long and thin, will slide into my brain and simply erase my sense of pain. \"You won't hurt anymore,\" he promised."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It's the promise I've been waiting for my whole life, but my heart is pounding with fear."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Pain has been my constant companion, my torturer... but I've never met anyone who lives without it. I'm \"a rare precedent,\" the doctor said."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If they take my pain away, who am I? Will people still love me when they no longer have to pity me?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I don't have the answers, Rocket."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-28dce9e2b318b546"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I spent the day hidden in the library, reading. There's a part I want to remember, to read to you one day:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "\"Your own happiness will come to you,"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "and curl up at your feet like a puppy."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "It will not care what you have become,"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "it will only understand, and love you.\""
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7b10585ea6952048"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Wish me luck tomorrow, Rocket. Please."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0fce2c1ad186bbae"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Happiness Report, Day 7:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I feel fine. A little dizzy now and then, but no real discomfort."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The doctor asked me if I still wanted to read. I'm just so tired, and it feels like too much trouble, so I told him no."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "He suggested visitors, if I'm bored. But I thought and thought, and drew a complete blank. There's no one I could think of."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3326d1e2e772aedb"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Happiness Journal, Day 24:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I think I'm starting to feel it. Happiness."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A nurse yelled at me today. It was the fifth time I'd spilled my food. But, I didn't feel bad at all."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The things that the production team brought kept getting lost or broken. Yet, I don't really feel sad about it."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Pain , guilt , sorrow , self-doubt ... all the negativity is just... gone!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Glory to The Laughter! So this is what it feels like! True happiness!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-034a55a01b6f7446"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Happiness Report, Day 52:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They discharged me. Assigned me a new job. As if it matters."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The producer asked if I wanted any of my things back. I don't. I didn't even take the congratulatory flowers they brought."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Don't get me wrong, I can laugh. I do. All the time."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But the only thing after laughing is more laughing. The only thing after happiness is more happiness, forever. And that's what makes it so... empty."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "So... tasteless."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-bb027efccd44a8b9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Happiness Report, Day 73:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Finally. I can hear it. just like the doctor said I would."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Aha is telling me to go find something."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This isn't about finding pure happiness. Or true happiness."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It's a need. An instinct. I have to find it."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But... what? What am I looking for?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2ba66aa31d2191e4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Happiness Report, Day ???:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I've read this whole journal again. I still don't know what I'm looking for."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mom? Dad? The show? Rocket? My fans? The doctor? Myself? What is it?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What is it?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What is it that matters? I don't know anymore. I'm already standing in the sunshine, right?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If the sun lights up everything, then why can't I see what I'm looking for..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5546e5eea78b70b5"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Happiness Report: Day ????"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I'm still looking. I have to keep looking..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "O Laughter above, please. Give me a little more time."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-26006a5fa85f4542"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Happiness Report: Day ?????"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "My time is up."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Goodbye, bright and sunny world."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0856fa686b2a0db7"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
